    <item>
      <title>RDL 语法</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rdl/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rdl/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;RDL (Resource &amp;amp; Rule Definition Language) 为 Apache ShardingSphere 的资源和规则定义语言。&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>RQL 语法</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rql/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rql/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;RQL (Resource &amp;amp; Rule Query Language) 为 Apache ShardingSphere 的资源和规则查询语言。&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>RAL 语法</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/ral/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/ral/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;RAL (Resource &amp;amp; Rule Administration Language) 为 Apache ShardingSphere 的管理语言，
负责事务类型切换、弹性伸缩等增量功能的操作。&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>RUL 语法</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rul/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/cn/user-manual/shardingsphere-proxy/distsql/syntax/rul/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;RUL (Resource Utility Language) 为 Apache ShardingSphere 的工具类语言，提供 SQL 解析、SQL 格式化、执行计划预览等功能。&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
